<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 339 0 R
/E (Cloud computing provides scalability and operational flexibility, but variable usage-based pricing can also produce waste, unexpected expenditure and weak budget predictability. Conventional cost dashboards are useful for historical analysis, yet static thresholds may miss contextual or slowly developing changes. This project develops an AI-Powered Cloud Cost Anomaly Detection and Budget Optimization System that ingests cloud billing data, validates and transforms cost records, detects abnormal expenditure patterns, forecasts future costs and presents recommendations through an interactive dashboard.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
